            "type": "game",
            "name": "Upwards, Lonely Robot",
            "steam_appid": 417900,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/800763602ba3bd13640fea2463ddc391.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=615 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/21c0b64a215050f53a8de0318a5b5515.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=108 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The vertical trial game that you’ve been waiting for! Who needs to go horizontal when you can go vertical?<br></li><li>Addictive and challenging puzzle platformer gameplay, a challenge for all gamers<br></li><li>Tons of levels to master<br></li><li>Online and local split-screen multiplayer with leaderboards for infinite mode – challenge your friends to get the highest scores and quickest times!<br></li><li>A mysterious and heart-wrenching story with a twist at the end for you to unravel as you progress through each level</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/29e644e87ae522a3f9bfe0abf61265ee.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=127 /></span><br>In Upwards, Lonely Robot, you are the eponymous android tasked with ascending a series of towers in the search for your creators. Each tower climbed unlocks a little more behind the mystery – with plenty of finger-twisting jumps and vicious enemies to overcome along the way. Not only that, but players must complete each level with an increasingly-challenging countdown timer putting them under even more pressure.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/800763602ba3bd13640fea2463ddc391.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=615 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/21c0b64a215050f53a8de0318a5b5515.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=108 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The vertical trial game that you’ve been waiting for! Who needs to go horizontal when you can go vertical?<br></li><li>Addictive and challenging puzzle platformer gameplay, a challenge for all gamers<br></li><li>Tons of levels to master<br></li><li>Online and local split-screen multiplayer with leaderboards for infinite mode – challenge your friends to get the highest scores and quickest times!<br></li><li>A mysterious and heart-wrenching story with a twist at the end for you to unravel as you progress through each level</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417900/extras/29e644e87ae522a3f9bfe0abf61265ee.avif?t=1627898361\" width=600 height=127 /></span><br>In Upwards, Lonely Robot, you are the eponymous android tasked with ascending a series of towers in the search for your creators. Each tower climbed unlocks a little more behind the mystery – with plenty of finger-twisting jumps and vicious enemies to overcome along the way. Not only that, but players must complete each level with an increasingly-challenging countdown timer putting them under even more pressure.",
            "short_description": "Simple to play but difficult to master, Upwards, Lonely Robot combines addictive ‘one more go’ gameplay with quirky and endearing art direction and an intriguingly cryptic story to bring you a gaming experience unlike any other.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha)<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 7,
                    "review_score_desc": "Positive",
                    "total_positive": 20,
                    "total_negative": 2,
                    "total_reviews": 22
                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "32726912",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198001794713",
                            "num_reviews": 516,
                            "playtime_forever": 94,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 94,
                            "last_played": 1498678825
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of the most boring games I have played in recent time.\n\n[h1]Pros:[/h1]\n\n+ graphics are okay\n+ music is alright\n+ controls work fine, fluent\n\n\n[h1]Cons:[/h1]\n\n- the game is flat out boring, there isnt anything exciting about climbing this tower\n- you gain no abilities or anything, this is just jumping up\n\n- the game tries to add variation and throws a couple of new obsticles here and there at you, but dodging a snail with jumping isnt any different from jumping over another insect.....\n\n- its basically only a race against time and you add time by collecting fruit....time is the only challenge here, Id much rather have a more difficult tower to climb\n\n- there is no depth....no unlockables, there is nothing but mindlessly jumping up\n\n- the price is outrageous compared to other games, you definitely can get much better and complex games than this one\n\n\nI wouldnt recommend this to anybody. This game comes off as being a 1€ mobile game. Way too simple and super overpriced.\n",
